<title>USA: Atmos Energy president resigns.</title>
<headline>Atmos Energy president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atmos Energy Corp said Monday that Robert Stephens resigned as president and chief operating officer, effective March 1.</p>
<p>The company said it has not yet named a replacement.</p>
<p>Stephens plans to remain a memeber of the Atmos board.</p>
